   ],
   "html": "<p>A curated group of influencers, creators and personalities joined us for an exclusive advanced screening of The Lion King live-action prequel <em>Mufasa</em> at the Roxy Theater in New York City.  </p>\n<p>We had a Q&amp;A with Aaron Pierre, Tiffany Boone, Kelvin Harrison Jr. and Anika Noni Rose, hosted by Cori Murray, downstairs in cellar jazz club The Django kicked off the evening. Bespoke decor, refreshments, musical programming and photo moments rounded out the unforgettable evening.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "pre-reception",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>The pre-reception kicked off the evening with entertainment and content opportunities, including a surprise and delight performance by African drummer Jason B. Lucas and a set from Afrobeats DJ Red Corvette. </p>",
     "right": "<p>Guests posed for a photo opp with the film’s title treatment and a scenic backdrop along with passed appetizers and custom cocktails named after key film scenes and themes.</p>"
    },
