  {
   "title": "SCREENING AND Q&A",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Notable editor, writer and personality Cori Murray moderated an exclusive Q&amp;A with film talent Aaron Pierre, Tiffany Boone, Kelvin Harrison Jr., and Anika Noni Rose. Afterwards, guests were guided to grab complimentary concessions before heading into the theater to enjoy the advanced screening of the film.</p>"
    },
    {
     "type": "gallery",
     "media": [
      {
       "type": "image",
       "src": "/images/6a16286f917854ce9f7ff7ec_12172024-Mufasa-102082.avif",
       "alt": ""
      },
      {
